    </div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>In this photograph, a person is riding it. → a <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="horse" data-hint="Choose the large animal that the person is riding in the photograph." data-fix="In this photograph, the person is riding a horse." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button></span></div>
