    <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>It lives in water, breathes with gills, has fins, and has no legs. → a <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="fish" data-hint="The combination of water, gills, fins, and no legs identifies a fish here." data-fix="A fish lives in water and breathes with gills." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button></span></div>
