    <div class="q"><span class="n">6</span><span>In this home, it is a small pet that can meow. → a <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="cat" data-hint="The pet sound meow identifies a cat." data-fix="In this home, the small pet is a cat." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button></span></div>
    <div class="q"><span class="n">7</span><span>It has feathers and wings. The animal in this picture is flying from one tree to another. → a <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="bird" data-hint="Feathers identify a bird. The picture also shows this bird flying." data-fix="The picture shows a bird with feathers and wings." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button></span></div>
