  <h2>Build the meaning, then the sentence</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>

  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-game data-success-message="Correct. Each match uses a distinguishing feature and avoids claiming that every member of a group behaves in exactly the same way.">
    <h3>Drill 2: match each animal to a true description</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">Tap an animal, then tap the description that fits it</p>
    <div class="tile-bank">
      <button class="tile" data-tile="elephant">an elephant</button>
      <button class="tile" data-tile="fish">a fish</button>
      <button class="tile" data-tile="bird">a bird</button>
      <button class="tile" data-tile="rabbit">a rabbit</button>
      <button class="tile" data-tile="cow">a cow</button>
      <button class="tile" data-tile="giraffe">a giraffe</button>
      <button class="tile" data-tile="penguin">a penguin</button>
    </div>
    <div class="slot-board">
      <button class="slot" data-slot="elephant" data-hint="An elephant has a trunk." data-fix="elephant → it is a large animal with a long trunk" data-placeholder="it is a large animal with a long trunk">it is a large animal with a long trunk</button>
      <button class="slot" data-slot="fish" data-hint="A fish breathes with gills and moves with fins." data-fix="fish → it lives in water and has gills and fins" data-placeholder="it lives in water and has gills and fins">it lives in water and has gills and fins</button>
      <button class="slot" data-slot="bird" data-hint="Feathers are the defining clue for a bird." data-fix="bird → it has feathers and wings; many birds can fly" data-placeholder="it has feathers and wings; many birds can fly">it has feathers and wings; many birds can fly</button>
      <button class="slot" data-slot="rabbit" data-hint="A rabbit commonly has long ears." data-fix="rabbit → it commonly has long ears" data-placeholder="it commonly has long ears">it commonly has long ears</button>
      <button class="slot" data-slot="cow" data-hint="Cow is the word for an adult female cattle animal." data-fix="cow → it is an adult female cattle animal" data-placeholder="it is an adult female cattle animal">it is an adult female cattle animal</button>
      <button class="slot" data-slot="giraffe" data-hint="The very long neck distinguishes a giraffe here." data-fix="giraffe → it has a very long neck" data-placeholder="it has a very long neck">it has a very long neck</button>
      <button class="slot" data-slot="penguin" data-hint="A penguin is a bird that swims but cannot fly." data-fix="penguin → it is a bird that swims but cannot fly" data-placeholder="it is a bird that swims but cannot fly">it is a bird that swims but cannot fly</button>
    </div>
    <div class="drill-actions">
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-check-tiles>Check</button>
      <button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-tiles>Reset</button>
    </div>
    <p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="the dogs are very friendly" data-hint="Begin with the plural subject The dogs, then use are before very friendly." data-fix="The dogs are very friendly." data-success-message="Correct. The plural subject The dogs takes are before the description very friendly.">
    <h3>Drill 3: talk about two dogs</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">A shelter note says that two dogs are very friendly. Build the sentence, then say it.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank>
