    <p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="she has a small cat" data-hint="Maya uses she. Begin with She has, then keep a small cat together." data-fix="She has a small cat." data-success-message="Correct. She refers to Maya, and a small cat names one animal.">
    <h3>Drill 4: talk about a friend’s pet</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">Maya uses <span class="ex">she</span>. She has one small cat. Build the sentence, then say it.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="cat">cat</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="she">She</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="small">small</button>
