  <h2>Read and choose</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>A fictional message about a neighbor's pets</h3>
    <p><span class="ex">“My neighbor has two dogs and a cat. The dogs are big and very friendly. The cat is small and black. Her name is Luna.”</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You found the number of dogs, their two descriptions, and the animal named Luna in the fictional message.">
    <h3>Drill 5: read, then choose</h3>
    <div class="quiz-list">
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="two" data-hint="The first sentence places a number directly before dogs." data-fix="The neighbor has two dogs.">
