        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="a giraffe">a giraffe</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="a rabbit">a rabbit</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="a duck">a duck</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="I have two rabbits." data-hint="After two, remove a and use the plural rabbits." data-fix="I have two rabbits.">
        <p class="quiz-question">7. Which sentence is correct?</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="I have two rabbits.">I have two rabbits.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="I have two rabbit.">I have two rabbit.</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="I have a two rabbits.">I have a two rabbits.</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="a penguin" data-hint="The bird in this clue swims but cannot fly." data-fix="It is a penguin.">
