  <section id="next-day-retrieval" data-lesson-extension="Five-minute next-day animal retrieval">
    <h2>Next-day retrieval</h2>
    <div class="lead-rule"></div>
    <div class="practice" data-choice-gap-drill data-success-message="Correct. You retrieved an before owl, foxes after two, unchanged sheep after three, and uncountable wildlife without a.">
      <h3>Complete from memory</h3>
      <div class="choice-bank" aria-label="Next-day animal choices">
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="a">a</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="an">an</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="foxes">foxes</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="foxs">foxs</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="sheep">sheep</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="sheeps">sheeps</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="wildlife">wildlife</button><button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="a wildlife">a wildlife</button>
      </div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>There is <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="an" data-hint="Owl begins with a vowel sound." data-fix="There is an owl." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> owl.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>The public photograph shows two <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="foxes" data-hint="Fox ends in x, so its plural adds -es." data-fix="The public photograph shows two foxes." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>The field has three <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="sheep" data-hint="Sheep does not change in the plural." data-fix="The field has three sheep." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">4</span><span>From the marked trail, we saw <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="wildlife" data-hint="Wildlife is an uncountable group word, so do not place a before it." data-fix="From the marked trail, we saw wildlife." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button>.</span></div>
      <div class="drill-actions"><button class="lesson-btn" data-check-choices>Check</button><button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-choices>Reset</button></div>
      <p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
    </div>
    <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="is" data-hint="The subject The dogs is plural, so check the form of be." data-fix="The dogs are near the handler." data-why="A plural subject takes are, not is.">
      <h3>Repair the agreement</h3>
      <p>Tap the word that is wrong.</p>
      <div class="spot-options"><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="the">The</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="dogs">dogs</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="is">is</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="near">near</button><button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="the-handler">the handler.</button></div>
      <p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p>
    </div>
